The legal texts are the Constitution of Alabama and the Code of Alabama 1975 as published by the Alabama Legislature
(alison.legislature.state.al.us). Statutes are not copyrightable subject matter (Georgia v. Public.Resource.Org, 2020);
only statute text is taken. Source histories, notes and annotations are not included. Source: Alabama Legislature, Code of
Alabama and Constitution of Alabama, alison.legislature.state.al.us. The site states no robots.txt restrictions and no
reuse terms for statute text.

The arrangement of this repository, its tables, commit messages and tools are by Lexifina and may be reused under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). This
repository is not legal advice and not an official publication.
